Data files    {#examples_data_files}
==========

VEF examples contain texture data for a few materials:

Material              | File              | Comment
----------------------|:-----------------:|------------------------------------
DC06 (IF steel)       | sid1727.c         | Measured at sheet mid-plane
DX51D (forming steel) | sid1687           | Measured at sheet mid-plane
AKDQ steel            | AKDQ.C            | Numisheet 2011 Benchmark 1 material


Input files    {#examples_input_files}
===========

Example input files for DX51D steel 
-----------------------------------

These examples typically use the default settings of the VEF:
- sid1687f_asr.cfg
- sid1687f_ewc.cfg
- sid1687f_qrs.cfg
- sid1687f_udsa.cfg
- sid1687f_yld.cfg

Example input files for AKDQ steel
-----------------------------------
These examples typically use non-default settings or set advanced settings:
- AKDQf_asr.cfg
- AKDQf_ewc.cfg
- AKDQf_qrs.cfg
- AKDQf_udsa.cfg
- AKDQf_yld.cfg

